Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository provides CLAS12 detector geometry, digitization, and plugins
built on GEMC. It is distributed with, or requires, third-party components that
are separately licensed; you must comply with their licenses in addition to the
Apache License, Version 2.0 that covers this repository. These include:

  - GEMC and its simulation stack: Geant4, CLHEP, Qt, ROOT, SQLite, Assimp
  - CLAS12 software: ccdb (Calibration Constants Database), clas12-cmag
    (CLAS12 magnetic field), and the HIPO I/O library (hipo-cpp)

